1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch1","children":["FOSA丨01丨软件架构概述"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨01丨软件架构概述"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第一章的课后思考题，深入探讨软件架构的四个定义维度、架构决策与设计原则的区别、软件架构师的核心职责，以及软件架构的第一定律，帮助建立对软件架构的全面认识。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-06-26T11:00:26.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/06/26"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","2,309"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第一章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["What are the four dimensions that define software architecture?",["$","br","br-0",{}],"\n软件架构定义的四个维度是什么？"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["What is the difference between an architecture decision and a design principle?",["$","br","br-0",{}],"\n架构决策和设计原则有什么区别？"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["List the eight core expectations of a software architect.",["$","br","br-0",{}],"\n软件架构师的核心期望有哪些？"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["What is the First Law of Software Architecture?",["$","br","br-0",{}],"\n软件架构的第一定律是什么？"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"1-软件架构定义的四个维度","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#1-软件架构定义的四个维度","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#1-软件架构定义的四个维度"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 软件架构定义的四个维度","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":4,"offset":526},"end":{"line":16,"column":18,"offset":540}}}]},"children":"1. 软件架构定义的四个维度"}]}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"structure of the system"}],": refres to the type of architecture style (or styles) the system is implemented in (such as microservices, layered, or microkernel)."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"architecture characteristics"}],": define the success criteria of a system, which is generally orthogonal to the functionality of the system."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"architecture decisions"}],": define the rules for how a system should be constructed."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"design principles"}],": differ from architecture decisions in that a design principle is a guideline rather than a hard-and-fast rule."]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"FOSA 中强调，软件架构不单单是\"架构\"本身，因为它无法揭示系统为何如此构建（why is more important than how），所以书中用了 4 个维度来定义软件架构的方方面面。"}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"11-系统结构","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#11-系统结构","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#11-系统结构"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1.1 系统结构","position":{"start":{"line":25,"column":5,"offset":1175},"end":{"line":25,"column":13,"offset":1183}}}]},"children":"1.1 系统结构"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"系统结构可能就是我们最常谈到的\"架构\"，指的的整个软件的架构风格（Architecture Style），例如微服务（Microservices）、分层架构（Layered）或微内核（Microkernel）。"}],"\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23"]}]}],"$L24","$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]]}]}]
